2026-08-22T14:19:44.9901956Z [36;1m# Pointing nm at `true` blinds the second one, so the check finds no[0m
2026-08-22T14:19:44.9902394Z [36;1m# symbols at all and reports "Found no calls to 'R_registerRoutines',[0m
